      "message": "Currently, the initialization phase traverses the entire USB bus twice (once in `GetDeviceCount`, again in `OpenDevice`), and uses `ConnectDevice` as an unnecessary wrapper.\n\n* **Action:** Delete `GetDeviceCount` and `ConnectDevice` entirely from `iap_control.cc` and `iap_control.h`.  \n* **Action:** Update `Initialize` to call `OpenDevice` directly:\n\n```c\nint IapControl::Initialize(uint16_t vid, uint16_t pid)\n{\n\tReleaseResource();\n\n\tif (!libusb_initialized_) {\n\t\tint err_code \u003d libusb_init(nullptr);\n\t\tif (err_code !\u003d 0) {\n\t\t\tLogInfo(\"[IAP] {} - libusb_init failed with code: {} ({})\\n\",\n\t\t\t\t__func__, err_code, libusb_error_name(err_code));\n\t\t\treturn -1;\n\t\t}\n\t\tlibusb_initialized_ \u003d true;\n\t}\n\n\tdevice_status_ \u003d OpenDevice(vid, pid);\n\tif (device_status_ \u003d\u003d -1) {\n\t\tLogInfo(\"[IAP] {} - failed to find or open device\\n\", __func__);\n\t\treturn -1;\n\t}\n\n\treturn 0;\n}\n\n```",
